their own.\n- Touch controllers or hand tracking. Teleport by pointing at the floor; snap turn with the thumbstick. Comfortable seated or standing.\n- Works offline. No ads, no accounts, no data collection.\n\nThe app's text is in Turkish. Atat\u00fcrk's works are in the public domain; the original lines were checked against the full text of Nutuk on Wikisource.", "short_description": "Sit in the 1927 Turkish Parliament hall: the original lines of Atat\u00fcrk's Nutuk appear above the empty rostrum with their meaning in today's Turkish beneath, while a relief map of the road to independence waits on the table in front of you."}]}, "developer_name": "Mr. Anduv!", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emreanduv.github.io/nutuk-salonu/gizlilik.html?v=2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mr. Anduv!", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/emreanduv/nutuk-akisi/issues", "website_url": "https://emreanduv.github.io/nutuk-salonu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["tr"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1491164244074179"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2340793553434502"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2340793553434502"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793981820, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2340793553434502"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_su